    <item>
      <title>New Version Available</title>
      <link>https://github.com/itsjoshpark/FrontRow</link>
      <sparkle:version>263</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.0.0 (263)</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/itsjoshpark/FrontRow/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:22:57 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/itsjoshpark/FrontRow/releases/download/v3.0.0/FrontRow_v3.0.0.dmg"
        sparkle:edSignature="Z3WR3bcOMiRYkjWEY4hxtzZCuuI11u8E8IbRBnQnLuFXK8xzXn478YQkIdTqglJ99I3BEQRnG5u3S2akAmwEBg=="
        length="3940157"
        type="application/octet-stream" />
      <description><![CDATA[
      <ul>
      <li>New: Front Row offers to convert and play MKV files if possible (using FFmpeg)</li>
      <li>New: Open URL distinguishes between network issue and actually unplayable files</li>
      <li>Changed: Experience Spatial Audio menu item renamed to Play Spatial Audio Sample</li>
      <li>Fixed: Play Spatial Audio Sample started playing without opening a player window</li>
      <li>Updated: App localizations</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Note</strong>: Front Row no longer runs in the app sandbox in order to use FFmpeg. The list of recently opened files will be reset due to this change.</p>
      ]]>
      </description>
    </item>

